    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a2">

                <pb facs="0548" n="454" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg454"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 423.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir J. Pauncefote to
                        Mr. Phelps</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 14,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my predecessor’s note of
                    the 30th of November last, I have the honor to transmit to you a copy of a
                    report from the Canadian minister of justice upon the seizure of the American
                    fishing vessel <hi rendition="#italic">Davids J. Adams.</hi></p>
                <p>I have forwarded a copy of this report to Her Majesty’s minister at Washington
                    for communication to the United States Government.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Pauncefote</hi></signed>,<lb/>(For
                    the Secretary of State.)</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
